monstrate. Generator builds. Kit Builder configures. Products fulfil. Start with the tool that answers your current question, then carry its compatible circuit into the next step.</p></section><article class=\"knowledge-tool\"><h3><a href=\"/circuit-forge/?sf=%7B%22version%22%3A1%2C%22configuration%22%3A%7B%22guitar%22%3A%22les-paul%22%2C%22wiring%22%3A%22modern%22%2C%22bleed%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22neckCap%22%3A%220.022%22%2C%22bridgeCap%22%3A%220.022%22%2C%22colours%22%3A%22generic%22%2C%22position%22%3A%22neck%22%2C%22shielding%22%3A%22yes%22%2C%22pickupProfiles%22%3A%7B%22neck%22%3A%22generic%22%2C%22bridge%22%3A%22generic%22%7D%7D%2C%22controlPositions%22%3A%7B%22neck%22%3A%7B%22volume%22%3A7%2C%22tone%22%3A10%7D%2C%22bridge%22%3A%7B%22volume%22%3A7%2C%22tone%22%3A10%7D%7D%2C%22responseAssumptions%22%3A%7B%22channels%22%3A%7B%22neck%22%3A%7B%22pickup%22%3A%22generic%22%2C%22volumePot%22%3A500%2C%22tonePot%22%3A500%7D%2C%22bridge%22%3A%7B%22pickup%22%3A%22generic%22%2C%22volumePot%22%3A500%2C%22tonePot%22%3A500%7D%7D%2C%22cableC%22%3A500%2C%22loadR%22%3A1%7D%7D&amp;mode=physical\">Signal Forge / Circuit Lab →</a></h3><p>Inspect the supported circuit topology, contacts and conductive paths.</p></article><article class=\"knowledge-tool\"><h3><a href=\"/circuit-forge/?sf=%7B%22version%22%3A1%2C%22configuration%22%3A%7B%22guitar%22%3A%22les-paul%22%2C%22wiring%22%3A%22modern%22%2C%22bleed%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22neckCap%22%3A%220.022%22%2C%22bridgeCap%22%3A%220.022%22%2C%22colours%22%3A%22generic%22%2C%22position%22%3A%22neck%22%2C%22shielding%22%3A%22yes%22%2C%22pickupProfiles%22%3A%7B%22neck%22%3A%22generic%22%2C%22bridge%22%3A%22generic%22%7D%7D%2C%22controlPositions%22%3A%7B%22neck%22%3A%7B%22volume%22%3A7%2C%22tone%22%3A10%7D%2C%22bridge%22%3A%7B%22volume%22%3A7%2C%22tone%22%3A10%7D%7D%2C%22responseAssumptions%22%3A%7B%22channels%22%3A%7B%22neck%22%3A%7B%22pickup%22%3A%22generic%22%2C%22volumePot%22%3A500%2C%22tonePot%22%3A500%7D%2C%22bridge%22%3A%7B%22pickup%22%3A%2